01:30.947 --> 01:35.957
Pursuing Hope

01:32.577 --> 01:35.667
<i>It's true that we've never</i>
<i>gotten along in the past...</i>

01:36.867 --> 01:41.497
<i>But we each did what we did</i>
<i>to protect our brethren and clans.</i>

01:41.827 --> 01:43.997
<i>There perhaps were times</i>
<i>we had no other choice.</i>

01:45.457 --> 01:49.117
<i>And now, today, even if</i>
<i>our Five Nation Treaty comes to be...</i>

01:49.207 --> 01:53.917
<i>I can't say how long it will last...</i>
<i>or if we can even hold to it.</i>

01:55.707 --> 01:58.667
<i>But I have this dream,</i>
<i>that sometime in the future...</i>

01:58.747 --> 02:01.287
<i>there will come a day when</i>
<i>shinobi will collaborate,</i>

02:01.367 --> 02:06.747
<i>and help each other, with one heart,</i>
<i>regardless of their affiliation.</i>

02:07.667 --> 02:08.787
<i>That is my...</i>

02:08.867 --> 02:11.747
My dream of the future.

02:13.667 --> 02:19.457
Seems like our generation no longer
needs to talk about that dream.

02:20.497 --> 02:21.537
Am I wrong?

02:22.117 --> 02:23.287
Indeed.

02:23.457 --> 02:24.917
That goes without saying.

02:25.787 --> 02:30.707
But if we don't win here,
it won't come to be!

02:31.287 --> 02:35.367
Tsuchikage is right.
Defeat is not an option.

02:35.577 --> 02:36.617
All right!

02:36.707 --> 02:39.117
We'll spread out and take command...

02:39.707 --> 02:42.827
and draw out the ultimate power
from the Allied Forces!

02:43.667 --> 02:47.497
That is our primary duty
as the Five Kage!

02:48.207 --> 02:49.497
– Scatter!
– Scatter!

03:26.247 --> 03:27.117
Sasuke!

03:27.207 --> 03:28.327
I'll keep in sync with you!

03:37.707 --> 03:38.707
Incredible...

03:39.247 --> 03:40.667
What just happened?

03:40.957 --> 03:44.037
Naruto and Sasuke are
attacking simultaneously.

03:44.617 --> 03:45.667
Did they succeed?

04:14.917 --> 04:16.667
You better be prepared...

04:20.827 --> 04:24.457
– I'll never let my comrades die!
– I'll never let my comrades die!

04:37.287 --> 04:38.167
This is...!

04:41.617 --> 04:42.667
<i>Naruto!</i>

04:48.207 --> 04:51.077
<i>Even as he's fighting,</i>
<i>he's helping his comrades recover...</i>

04:55.747 --> 04:59.667
<i>Naruto! Just focus on</i>
<i>what only you can do!</i>

04:59.867 --> 05:01.707
<i>Leave the healing to me!</i>

05:02.707 --> 05:03.867
You don't understand, Sakura.

05:04.617 --> 05:06.497
Naruto is doing this unconsciously.

05:06.537 --> 05:07.457
Huh?

05:07.997 --> 05:10.037
His chakra is acting on its own,

05:10.117 --> 05:12.537
from his deep desire to
help Shikamaru.

05:12.917 --> 05:16.497
I can sense it clearly from
my Mind Transmission Jutsu.

05:22.747 --> 05:27.667
<i>Damn it, Naruto...</i>
<i>You never change.</i>

05:28.707 --> 05:30.957
<i>You're always going overboard...</i>

05:32.167 --> 05:35.037
<i>Sticking your neck out for us...</i>
<i>How far will you go...?</i>

05:35.417 --> 05:42.037
<i>All this time, you've never held back</i>
<i>or compromised when it came to us.</i>

05:43.667 --> 05:48.997
<i>In front of you, I can't complain about</i>
<i>what a drag things are...</i>

05:53.867 --> 05:56.707
Sorry, Dad...

05:57.577 --> 06:01.617
Naruto doesn't want me...
to join you just yet.

06:01.707 --> 06:03.867
Shikamaru, stop talking!

06:04.577 --> 06:06.617
I‘m not letting you die!

06:07.747 --> 06:10.537
Naruto... rather, everybody needs you!

06:15.917 --> 06:17.077
<i>Dad...</i>

06:17.457 --> 06:19.667
<i>I only found out later that</i>

06:19.747 --> 06:25.417
<i>Naruto had gone through a ton</i>
<i>of painful, bitter things on his own.</i>

06:27.707 --> 06:33.077
<i>I don't ever want him to</i>
<i>go through that again,</i>

06:33.167 --> 06:38.457
<i>or at least that's how I feel...</i>
<i>when I'm with him.</i>

06:41.827 --> 06:45.497
<i>I told you once, remember, Dad?</i>

06:47.827 --> 06:52.167
<i>Someday, he's going to become</i>
<i>a very important ninja to this village.</i>

06:54.077 --> 07:01.787
<i>When I'm with Naruto...</i>
<i>he makes me want to follow him.</i>

07:05.917 --> 07:13.207
<i>Unlike Lord First, that dumb Naruto</i>
<i>doesn't have an adept brother...</i>

07:13.287 --> 07:15.617
<i>like Lord Second, to be his advisor.</i>

07:17.617 --> 07:21.207
<i>That's why... even more so...</i>

07:22.367 --> 07:25.207
<i>I need to stick around so that</i>
<i>when he becomes the Hokage,</i>

07:25.287 --> 07:28.207
<i>I can stand next to that idiot.</i>

07:31.827 --> 07:37.747
<i>So I'm sorry, Dad...</i>
<i>I can't join you just yet.</i>

07:39.707 --> 07:44.667
<i>There's no one more qualified than me</i>
<i>to be Naruto's advisor.</i>

07:50.417 --> 07:52.707
<i>Naruto, thank you...</i>

07:53.457 --> 07:57.787
<i>Your chakra and the power</i>
<i>of your heart saved him!</i>

07:58.707 --> 08:00.537
Yes! He's rallied!

08:01.167 --> 08:02.537
Thank you, Sakura.

08:04.077 --> 08:05.787
<i>Thank you, Naruto.</i>

08:06.367 --> 08:08.207
Don't overdo it, Shikamaru.

08:08.287 --> 08:10.747
You just might become
my advisor instead!

08:13.497 --> 08:15.117
Don't worry, Akamaru.

08:15.667 --> 08:18.667
It's because a Kage can have
up to three advisors.

08:19.827 --> 08:23.457
<i>I want to stay by Naruto too.</i>

08:23.537 --> 08:24.787
<i>I'll have to work hard!</i>

08:25.117 --> 08:26.577
Shikamaru!

08:33.707 --> 08:35.117
Lady Tsunade!

08:38.457 --> 08:39.867
You did well!

08:44.287 --> 08:47.287
Forgive me, Grandfather.

08:48.287 --> 08:50.917
Tsuna, don't apologize.

08:52.997 --> 08:55.787
I dragged this mess into
my grandchildren's era.

08:55.867 --> 08:58.037
My cowardice is to blame...

08:58.667 --> 09:02.037
But your heart and dreams have
also been passed down

09:02.997 --> 09:06.957
even beyond your grandchildren's era...

09:08.417 --> 09:09.917
Yes, your...

09:09.997 --> 09:11.667
Will of Fire!

09:12.417 --> 09:14.367
Hey!

09:17.367 --> 09:18.917
Why you...!

09:20.867 --> 09:22.037
All right!

09:22.117 --> 09:26.417
Let's cut down this giant tree while
he is distracted by his battle!

09:30.747 --> 09:33.577
No matter how large it may be,

09:33.667 --> 09:37.207
that tree is nothing compared
to this very earth!

09:38.457 --> 09:41.037
And the great earth,
this land is on our side!

09:41.827 --> 09:43.667
– Right!
– Right!

09:46.787 --> 09:48.327
<i>I'm begging you!</i>

09:48.537 --> 09:51.707
<i>I don't want us killing each other</i>
<i>out of vengeance anymore!</i>

09:52.667 --> 09:54.957
<i>A ninja does not bow</i>
<i>his head so easily!</i>

09:55.617 --> 09:58.707
<i>A ninja values action and strength!</i>

10:03.417 --> 10:07.287
<i>It seems those who become Hokage</i>
<i>like prostrating themselves, but...</i>

10:08.207 --> 10:10.827
<i>As an act that relays one's heart,</i>

10:10.917 --> 10:13.707
<i>perhaps it can lead to strength</i>
<i>and be meritorious too.</i>

10:15.247 --> 10:16.867
Let's go, everyone!

10:17.247 --> 10:20.747
Okay! Double lariat time, bro! Yeah!

10:21.037 --> 10:22.787
– Here we go!
– Here we go!

10:22.997 --> 10:26.957
As a woman, I mustn't get
a late start on battle...

10:27.667 --> 10:29.867
All right, everyone. Let's go!

10:29.957 --> 10:32.617
– Right!
– Right!

10:42.117 --> 10:43.247
Damn it!

10:52.707 --> 10:53.997
<i>Naruto...</i>

10:55.667 --> 11:00.077
<i>You have truly become a necessary</i>
<i>existence to this world...</i>

11:00.827 --> 11:03.497
<i>What the two of us had</i>
<i>always wanted to be.</i>

11:03.747 --> 11:07.667
<i>And you will now save</i>
<i>the entire world, Naruto!</i>

11:07.917 --> 11:09.667
– Everyone, follow me!
– Everyone, follow me!

11:09.747 --> 11:13.367
– Let's go!
– Let's go!

11:21.747 --> 11:24.747
All right, I think I should
get going now.

11:25.747 --> 11:30.787
The springtime of my youth...
hasn't ended yet!

11:30.867 --> 11:33.207
Let's go, Lee! Tenten!

11:33.747 --> 11:34.747
– Yes!
– Right!

11:35.617 --> 11:38.617
<i>Your past is filtering into me</i>
<i>through the others.</i>

11:41.747 --> 11:45.867
<i>Naruto Uzumaki, you are uniting</i>
<i>everyone right now.</i>

11:46.457 --> 11:51.037
<i>Your tempestuous life made you</i>
<i>into who you are.</i>

11:51.707 --> 11:56.957
<i>And your way of life has given</i>
<i>everyone's hearts hope!</i>

11:59.207 --> 12:01.747
Let us pursue hope! Onward!

12:08.557 --> 12:10.097
Let's do it!

12:11.137 --> 12:12.227
Let's go!

12:21.227 --> 12:23.267
Let's cut down that giant tree!

12:27.307 --> 12:29.097
We samurai must not waver either!

12:29.597 --> 12:30.937
Go forth!

12:34.267 --> 12:35.307
Let's go too.

12:35.597 --> 12:37.387
Are you okay though, Shikamaru?

12:37.477 --> 12:40.387
Yeah, I'm fully recovered.

12:40.687 --> 12:43.807
But what if that tree robs us
of our chakra again...?

12:43.887 --> 12:46.137
Now that we know,
just have to be careful.

12:49.307 --> 12:55.187
Fourth, I'm going to use the link
between your chakra and Naruto's.

12:55.937 --> 12:58.597
I can't move simultaneously like you,

12:58.687 --> 13:01.767
but I'll still help protect them
all with my Teleportation Jutsu.

13:03.057 --> 13:04.347
Orochimaru...

13:05.097 --> 13:08.057
Are you just going to spectate?

13:09.267 --> 13:12.517
I have no interest in this war.

13:14.977 --> 13:20.477
However, this dream of Obito's would
lead to the elimination of this,

13:20.557 --> 13:23.557
my precious laboratory...

13:24.137 --> 13:26.637
So I suppose I cannot support it.

13:28.017 --> 13:29.977
Then lend me a hand.

13:32.267 --> 13:34.137
Fine then.

13:34.137 --> 13:37.977
I'll partake in a bit of nostalgia...

13:38.847 --> 13:42.847
and participate in some
student and teacher teamwork!

13:45.557 --> 13:47.937
<i>I'll shift to a more offensive form!</i>

13:51.847 --> 13:52.807
What is it?!

13:52.887 --> 13:53.807
Do not panic!

13:53.887 --> 13:54.687
It's coming!

13:59.187 --> 13:59.847
Huh?!

14:00.137 --> 14:01.097
What?

14:02.347 --> 14:05.977
<i>I'll use my Teleportation Jutsu</i>
<i>to whisk anyone in danger away.</i>

14:06.057 --> 14:07.267
So go forth without fear!

14:07.557 --> 14:09.137
It's the voice of Lord Second!

14:09.477 --> 14:12.767
We can give it our all.
It's because...

14:13.057 --> 14:15.057
Still, don't get careless!

14:15.437 --> 14:18.347
With two 100 Healings adepts,
we can likely summon

14:18.437 --> 14:22.387
one-tenth of Katsuyu's actual body here
from Shikkotsu Woods!

14:23.017 --> 14:25.477
We'll mold Katsuyu into
the Allied Force's entire footing,

14:25.557 --> 14:29.517
into a Healing Area where one can
be restored just by standing on her.

14:30.227 --> 14:31.347
Ready, Sakura?

14:31.597 --> 14:32.437
Yes!

14:34.097 --> 14:35.847
– Summoning Jutsu!
– Summoning Jutsu!

14:40.267 --> 14:42.227
Ino! Have you relayed that to everyone?

14:42.477 --> 14:43.137
Yes!

14:47.477 --> 14:50.137
Huh? What's that going to do?

14:50.137 --> 14:51.057
Is this it?!

14:51.057 --> 14:54.267
This way, we can fight without
our chakra being stolen!

14:54.347 --> 14:56.267
Oh, this is great!

14:56.347 --> 14:58.267
So this is the Healing Area?!

14:58.347 --> 15:00.887
If you understand,
quit playing around and get going!

15:05.847 --> 15:06.887
<i>Where's Naruto?</i>

15:15.267 --> 15:15.937
<i>Damn it!</i>

15:16.227 --> 15:17.307
<i>He really is fast...!</i>

15:18.097 --> 15:19.267
<i>But...</i>

15:20.137 --> 15:22.307
<i>I'm starting to sense him</i>
<i>better and better!</i>

15:24.267 --> 15:25.057
– <i>Right there!</i>
– <i>Right there!</i>

15:33.807 --> 15:36.437
It's about time that you go to sleep.

15:39.137 --> 15:41.307
I'll guide you into the dream.

15:44.557 --> 15:46.977
There's no time left!

16:06.387 --> 16:07.347
<i>Obito...</i>

16:08.557 --> 16:12.727
<i>I bet you really did want</i>
<i>to confirm...</i>

16:24.187 --> 16:29.227
<i>whether a heart that never bends and</i>
<i>a Will of Fire that does not waver...</i>

16:30.807 --> 16:33.137
<i>are truly possible.</i>

16:36.137 --> 16:38.267
<i>You gave up on them once.</i>

16:40.017 --> 16:45.097
<i>But after fighting Naruto</i>
<i>and hearing his words...</i>

16:45.227 --> 16:49.057
<i>deep down, you're not able to deny</i>
<i>that they might really exist.</i>

16:49.137 --> 16:51.187
<i>Isn't that right, Obito?</i>

16:54.387 --> 16:57.887
<i>And yet, you still search</i>

16:57.977 --> 17:02.767
<i>and test everyone and everything</i>
<i>to prove yourself wrong.</i>

17:06.887 --> 17:10.017
<i>Which is why even now,</i>
<i>as you stand at the precipice...</i>

17:24.977 --> 17:25.887
Huh?!

17:26.097 --> 17:26.887
What?!

17:27.477 --> 17:28.477
What is that?!

17:42.437 --> 17:43.887
What was that just now?!

17:44.057 --> 17:46.187
Naruto and Sasuke are...

17:48.267 --> 17:49.267
But wait...!

18:13.137 --> 18:18.267
<i>You seek the answer... in Naruto.</i>

18:22.977 --> 18:24.387
Why do you get up?!

18:26.557 --> 18:29.347
And what are you fighting for?

18:30.097 --> 18:34.227
Is it for your comrades?
Or is it for this world?

18:40.687 --> 18:44.977
Listen, friends will eventually betray you.

18:46.517 --> 18:50.767
And this world transforms love
into hatred.

18:51.307 --> 18:53.387
You should know!

18:55.387 --> 18:59.437
In the past, the people of the village
and Sasuke betrayed you.

19:02.017 --> 19:06.097
And your love for Jiraiya
made you hate.

19:11.227 --> 19:13.097
You and I are the same.

19:14.687 --> 19:18.687
The cumulative weight of all
your suffering will change you in time.

19:19.187 --> 19:23.387
And now, even more pain
shall assault you.

19:24.937 --> 19:28.937
And you still insist that
you will not change?!

19:30.687 --> 19:34.227
You don't know when your friends
will betray you again...

19:34.937 --> 19:38.057
Or if the Allied Forces might
go back to fighting each other.

19:38.637 --> 19:42.267
And you don't even know
if you can defeat me!

19:42.937 --> 19:47.187
There is no reason to keep on
fighting for a world like this.

19:49.847 --> 19:53.637
In a few minutes,
this world will be gone anyway.

19:56.097 --> 19:58.517
Why do you still fight?

20:09.347 --> 20:12.847
Because it's my Ninja Way.

20:16.557 --> 20:19.847
I never go back on my word.

20:20.267 --> 20:23.267
That's my Ninja Way.

20:32.097 --> 20:34.437
I thought I told you to go to sleep!

20:39.887 --> 20:42.637
Let's settle this with
our next move, Naruto!

20:43.097 --> 20:44.057
Right!

20:55.937 --> 21:00.057
We'll sleep tomorrow,
dreaming our own dreams!

